estaurant selections and carefully prepared Jain and vegan food restaurant dishes ensure every dietary preference is respected. Families often name us their preferred family-friendly Indian vegetarian restaurant, and locals regularly recognise us among the top-rated Indian veg restaurants near me and the best dosa restaurant in Tooting. For events of any size, our 100% pure vegetarian catering services, including live dosa catering and professional outdoor catering, bring authentic flavours directly to your celebration.</p><p>Tooting Broadway, located in South London, is a lively neighbourhood known for its energetic vibe and multicultural character. The area is home to Tooting Market and Broadway Market, where visitors can discover a wide mix of global food stalls, independent shops, and distinctive eateries. Close by is Tooting Bec Lido—one of the UK’s largest outdoor pools—nestled within the scenic Tooting Commons, an ideal place for picnics, gentle walks, and outdoor leisure. With its impressive selection of South Asian dining spots, especially along the famed “Curry Corridor,” Tooting Broadway stands out as a must-visit destination that blends natural spaces, local personality, and cultural richness.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"d28d97c","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"row","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"a0a780e","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_justify_content":"center","flex_align_items":"flex-start","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#EBE6E0","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"box_shadow_hover_box_shadow_type":"yes","box_shadow_hover__boxshadow_h":{"unit":"px","size":1,"sizes":[]},"box_shadow_hover__boxshadow_v":{"unit":"px",